{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"fe25890ffbb091a0","__entryId":"backdrop-blur","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div class=\"glass-sc-view\" style=\"height:132px;border:1px solid var(--border)\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:url('/assets/slide-city.png') center/cover\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;padding:44px 16px 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n        <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.85);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px\"><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">雨后的大理古城</b><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:2px\">3.2 万阅读 · 486 收藏</div></div>\n        <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.85);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px\"><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">环洱海骑行一日路线</b><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:2px\">1.8 万阅读 · 302 收藏</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"glass-sc-frost\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:34px;border:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.6);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:0 14px;z-index:2\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">旅记</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand);font-weight:600\">首页</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">目的地</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">我的</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"glass-sc-view\" style=\"height:132px;background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\">\n      <div class=\"glass-sc-frost\" style=\"position:absolute;left:14px;bottom:14px;width:230px;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text)\">山居民宿 · 云顶</b>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin:3px 0 7px\">海拔 1,200 米，推开窗就是云海</div>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">¥ 688 / 晚</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag green\">可订</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"glass-sc-view\" style=\"height:140px;border:1px solid var(--border)\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:url('/assets/cover-workspace.png') center/cover\"></div>\n      <div class=\"glass-sc-frost\" style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:250px;max-width:calc(100% - 32px);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text)\">退出前保存修改？</b>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin:3px 0 10px\">「首页改版 v2」还有未保存的改动</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">不保存</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">保存</button></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"glass-sc-view\" style=\"height:138px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#312e81,#7c3aed 60%,#db2777)\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:270px;max-width:calc(100% - 32px);background:rgba(0,0,0,.38);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);border-radius:12px;padding:11px 13px\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/slide-forest.png\" style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;object-fit:cover\" alt=\"\">\n          <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis\">夜航星 (Night Voyager)</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.65)\">不才 · 我的三体</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.25);margin:10px 0 8px\"><div style=\"width:42%;height:100%;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg)\"></div></div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:22px;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9)\"><span>⏮</span><span>▶</span><span>⏭</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div class=\"glass-sc-view\" style=\"height:132px;border:1px solid var(--border)\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:url('/assets/slide-city.png') center/cover\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;padding:44px 16px 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n        <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.85);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px\"><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">Dali Ancient City after the rain</b><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:2px\">32,000 reads · 486 collections</div></div>\n        <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.85);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px\"><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">One-day cycling route around Erhai Lake</b><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:2px\">18,000 reads · 302 collections</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"glass-sc-frost\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:34px;border:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.6);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:0 14px;z-index:2\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">Travel Notes</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand);font-weight:600\">Homepage</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Destination</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">My</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"glass-sc-view\" style=\"height:132px;background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\">\n      <div class=\"glass-sc-frost\" style=\"position:absolute;left:14px;bottom:14px;width:230px;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text)\">Mountain Homestay · Genting</b>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin:3px 0 7px\">1,200 meters above sea level, open the window and see the sea of clouds</div>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">¥ 688 / night</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag green\">Available to order</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"glass-sc-view\" style=\"height:140px;border:1px solid var(--border)\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:url('/assets/cover-workspace.png') center/cover\"></div>\n      <div class=\"glass-sc-frost\" style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:250px;max-width:calc(100% - 32px);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text)\">Save changes before exiting? </b>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin:3px 0 10px\">\"Home Page Revision v2\" has unsaved changes</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">Do not save</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Save</button></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"glass-sc-view\" style=\"height:138px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#312e81,#7c3aed 60%,#db2777)\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:270px;max-width:calc(100% - 32px);background:rgba(0,0,0,.38);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);border-radius:12px;padding:11px 13px\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/slide-forest.png\" style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;object-fit:cover\" alt=\"\">\n          <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis\">Night Voyager</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.65)\">Bucai · My Three Body</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.25);margin:10px 0 8px\"><div style=\"width:42%;height:100%;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg)\"></div></div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:22px;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9)\"><span>⏮</span><span>▶</span><span>⏭</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"glass-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"backdrop\"><span class=\"glass-anat-swatch\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\"></span></span><span class=\"glass-anat-plus\">+</span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"blur\"><span class=\"glass-anat-swatch glass-anat-frost\">blur(12px)</span></span><span class=\"glass-anat-plus\">+</span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"tint\"><span class=\"glass-anat-swatch glass-anat-tintchip\">rgba 白 55%</span></span><span class=\"glass-anat-plus\">=</span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"card\"><span class=\"glass-anat-swatch\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover;position:relative;overflow:hidden\"><span class=\"glass-anat-final\">毛玻璃卡</span></span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"glass-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"backdrop\"><span class=\"glass-anat-swatch\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\"></span></span><span class=\"glass-anat-plus\">+</span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"blur\"><span class=\"glass-anat-swatch glass-anat-frost\">blur(12px)</span></span><span class=\"glass-anat-plus\">+</span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"tint\"><span class=\"glass-anat-swatch glass-anat-tintchip\">rgba white 55%</span></span><span class=\"glass-anat-plus\">=</span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"card\"><span class=\"glass-anat-swatch\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover;position:relative;overflow:hidden\"><span class=\"glass-anat-final\">frosted glass card</span></span></span></span>","parts":[{"key":"backdrop","cn":"背景内容","en":"Backdrop","desc":"元素身后的东西：图片、渐变、滚动的页面","desc_en":"What’s behind the elements: images, gradients, scrolling pages"},{"key":"blur","cn":"模糊","en":"blur()","desc":"backdrop-filter 的模糊半径，越大越看不清","desc_en":"The blur radius of backdrop-filter, the larger it is, the harder it is to see"},{"key":"tint","cn":"半透明底色","en":"rgba Tint","desc":"没有它 blur 不生效，还顺手托住文字对比度","desc_en":"Without it, blur will not take effect, and it can easily maintain the text contrast."},{"key":"card","cn":"毛玻璃成品","en":"Frosted Card","desc":"三者叠加的最终效果：若隐若现、层次分明","desc_en":"The final effect of the superposition of the three: vague and clear-cut"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"浅色玻璃","en":"Light","demo":"<span class=\"glass-v\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\"><span class=\"glass-v-chip light\">浅色玻璃</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"glass-v\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\"><span class=\"glass-v-chip light\">Light glass</span></span>","when":"背景较亮、仍能保持文字对比度时","when_en":"When the background is bright and text contrast can still be maintained"},{"cn":"深色玻璃","en":"Dark","demo":"<span class=\"glass-v\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\"><span class=\"glass-v-chip dark\">深色玻璃</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"glass-v\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\"><span class=\"glass-v-chip dark\">Dark glass</span></span>","when":"深色底图或夜间模式界面","when_en":"Dark basemap or night mode interface"},{"cn":"强模糊","en":"Strong","demo":"<span class=\"glass-v\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\"><span class=\"glass-v-chip strong\">强模糊</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"glass-v\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\"><span class=\"glass-v-chip strong\">Strong blur</span></span>","when":"弹窗背后要更强隔离感","when_en":"There needs to be a stronger sense of isolation behind pop-up windows"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>吸顶 {c:navbar}</b>：内容从底下滚过，若隐若现","m":"glass-nav"},{"t":"<b>浮层与对话框</b>：和下层保持联系，又分得清前后","m":"glass-modal"},{"t":"<b>配图区的信息卡</b>：风景图上盖一张玻璃卡","m":"glass-card"},{"t":"<b>配半透明底色</b>：rgba 白 / 黑加 blur，一对搭档","m":"glass-tint"}],"dont":[{"t":"背景使用<b>不透明纯色</b>：backdrop-filter 无法呈现底层内容","m":"glass-solid","bad":true},{"t":"<b>大面积内容使用重度模糊</b>：可能影响性能与可读性","m":"glass-heavy","bad":true},{"t":"底色过透、模糊过轻：<b>正文与背景对比度不足</b>","m":"glass-read","bad":true},{"t":"<b>移动端叠加多层模糊</b>：可能降低低性能设备的流畅度","m":"glass-mobile","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"吸顶导航想做毛玻璃效果，但当前背景完全不透明，低性能手机滚动时也有卡顿。怎样处理？","options":[{"id":"translucent-tested-backdrop","label":"使用半透明底色配合适度模糊，并准备可读的纯色降级方案","feedback":"透明底让背后内容参与模糊，克制范围和纯色回退还能兼顾性能与可读性。","correct":true},{"id":"opaque-blurred-nav","label":"保留不透明背景，只继续增加 backdrop blur 的模糊半径","feedback":"不透明背景挡住后方画面，再大的背景模糊也无法形成可见毛玻璃。","correct":false},{"id":"full-page-heavy-blur","label":"把重度模糊扩展到整页内容，让所有区域保持相同风格","feedback":"大面积多层模糊会增加渲染负担，也会让正文和状态失去清晰边界。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A sticky navigation needs a glass effect, but its background is fully opaque and low-end phones stutter while scrolling. What should change?","options":[{"id":"translucent-tested-backdrop","label":"Combine a translucent surface with restrained blur and provide a readable solid-color fallback","feedback":"Transparency exposes content to the backdrop filter, while limited scope and fallback protect performance and readability.","correct":true},{"id":"opaque-blurred-nav","label":"Keep the opaque background and continue increasing the backdrop-blur radius","feedback":"An opaque surface hides the scene behind it, so increasing backdrop blur cannot produce visible glass.","correct":false},{"id":"full-page-heavy-blur","label":"Extend heavy blur across the whole page so every region uses the same style","feedback":"Large layered blur increases rendering cost and removes clear boundaries from body content and states.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请把吸顶导航做成半透明底色加适度 backdrop blur，确保文字在滚动到任何背景上都可读。不支持或性能不足时回退到清楚的纯色背景；测试低性能手机、深色模式和多层浮层。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Use a translucent surface and restrained backdrop blur for the sticky navigation, keeping text readable over every scrolled background. Fall back to a clear solid surface when unsupported or slow, and test low-end mobile, dark mode, and layered overlays."}},"references":[{"title":"backdrop-filter 属性","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/backdrop-filter","title_en":"backdrop-filter"}],"scenes":["吸顶毛玻璃导航","风景图上的玻璃卡片","对话框与浮层","深色模式玻璃面板"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Floating header over imagery","m":"glass-nav"},{"t":"Compact overlay or control surface","m":"glass-modal"},{"t":"Glass-style panel with readable text","m":"glass-card"},{"t":"Separate a layer without fully hiding the background","m":"glass-tint"}],"dont":[{"t":"Place low-contrast text over unpredictable images","m":"glass-solid","bad":true},{"t":"Apply strong blur to many nested surfaces","m":"glass-heavy","bad":true},{"t":"Rely on blur as the only boundary","m":"glass-read","bad":true},{"t":"Ignore browsers or devices where the effect is limited","m":"glass-mobile","bad":true}],"scenes":["Floating navbar","Media controls","Overlay panel","Glass card"],"sceneUI":["<div class=\"glass-sc-view\" style=\"height:132px;border:1px solid var(--border)\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:url('/assets/slide-city.png') center/cover\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;padding:44px 16px 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n        <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.85);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px\"><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">Dali Ancient City after the rain</b><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:2px\">32,000 reads · 486 collections</div></div>\n        <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.85);bo