span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);padding:4px 8px\">风景图上的玻璃卡，轻盈有层级</span></div>","glass-tint":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:76px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover;position:relative;overflow:hidden\"><span style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px)\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);max-width:110px\">rgba 半透明底色 + blur，一对搭档</span></div>","glass-solid":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover;border:none\"><span style=\"background:var(--bg);border-radius:5px;padding:4px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--red);align-self:flex-start\">背景写了纯白，blur 白写了</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#fff;text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\">不透明背景 = 毛玻璃完全不生效</span></div>","glass-heavy":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover;border:none\"><span style=\"flex:1;background:rgba(255,255,255,.6);backdrop-filter:blur(24px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(24px);border-radius:5px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;color:#23262c\">整页内容罩一层重模糊</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#fff;text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\">大面积重度模糊，又卡又看不清</span></div>","glass-read":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover;border:none\"><span style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(4px);border-radius:5px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;color:#fff;line-height:1.6\">背景透明度过高且模糊不足时，正文会与背景互相干扰。</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#fff;text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\">先保证文字对比度和可读性</span></div>","glass-mobile":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-phone\"><span style=\"display:block;height:12px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(22,93,255,.12);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)\"></span><span style=\"display:block;height:12px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(22,93,255,.12);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)\"></span><span style=\"display:block;height:12px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(22,93,255,.12);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red);max-width:110px\">移动端叠加多层模糊，可能影响低性能设备流畅度</span></div>"}}}